Why GPL-3.0
-----------
Two parts of this repository are derived from, or copied verbatim from,
LandSandBoat, which is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0:

  * lsb/ffxi_lsb_tables.py is GENERATED from LandSandBoat's source by
    tools/gen_ffxi_lsb_tables.py: the currency packet layouts and their
    char_points column mapping (src/map/packets/s2c/0x113_currencies_1 and
    0x118_currencies_2), the learned-ability and weapon-skill unlock tables
    (sql/abilities.sql, sql/weapon_skills.sql), the quest and mission log
    enums and structures (src/map/enums/quest_log.h, mission_log.h,
    src/common/mmo.h, src/map/entities/char_entity.h) and the home point
    table (scripts/globals/homepoint.lua, data/enums/zone.yaml).

  * tools/ffxi_bfdiff/common/cbasetypes.h is a verbatim copy of lines 40-47
    of LandSandBoat's src/common/cbasetypes.h, and tools/ffxi_bfdiff/harness.cpp
    is built against LandSandBoat's unmodified blowfish.cpp and md52.cpp,
    which are not included here (the header of harness.cpp says where to get
    them).

The rest of the repository is original work released under the same license.

